{"key": "3d255e815e5aada0d71417d050bdd439540f47d264389d03ec06c80f05b1218e", "value": {"response": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\n\ndef rescale_to_unit(numbers: List[float]) -> List[float]:\n    min_num = min(numbers)\n    max_num = max(numbers)\n    return [(num - min_num) / (max_num - min_num) for num in numbers]\n```", "prompt_eval_count": 298, "eval_count": 59}}
